## 🚀 **Performance Testing**

### **Load Testing Patterns:**
```csharp
[Test]
public async Task CreateAccount_ConcurrentRequests_HandlesLoad()
{
    var tasks = Enumerable.Range(0, 100)
        .Select(i => Client.PostAsJsonAsync("/api/account", new CreateAccountDTO
        {
            Email = $"test{i}@example.com",
            Password = "TestPassword123!",
            FirstName = "Test",
            LastName = "User"
        }))
        .ToArray();
    
    var responses = await Task.WhenAll(tasks);
    
    responses.Should().AllSatisfy(r => r.StatusCode.Should().Be(HttpStatusCode.Created));
}
```

