## 📋 **Test Organization**

### **Test Categories:**
```csharp
[Test]
[Category("Unit")]
public async Task CreateAccount_ValidInput_ReturnsAccountDTO()

[Test]
[Category("Integration")]
public async Task CreateAccount_ValidInput_ReturnsCreatedAccount()

[Test]
[Category("Performance")]
